cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AsOf: Time-Aware RAG for Indian GST Law"
abstract: >-
  AsOf is an open-source, time-aware retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) system for
  Indian GST law. It answers "what was the rule on date X?" by storing a validity date
  range for every notification, circular and provision, following amendment and
  supersession chains, and verifying that every cited quote appears in its source.
authors:
